    "created_at": "2022-12-19T15:59:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-12-19T15:59:19Z",
    "body": "For clarity, if your username is `%25DOMAIN` you would have to percent-encode it before stuffing it in the URL: `%2525DOMAIN`. The URL parser will not percent-encode `%` for you. #727 attempts to clarify this. (My example doesn't use username, but the same principle applies.)",
